# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository accompanies bioRxiv 10.1101/2025.02.12.637810 version 2.
# It is scoped to what regenerates that manuscript. Two categories are excluded
# on purpose.
#
# 1. Third-party data too large to redistribute. Provenance and fetch
#    instructions are kept; the bytes are not. See data/raw/*/PROVENANCE.json.
# 2. A separate, unfinished line of work analysing another group's published
#    model. It is not part of this manuscript, the authors of that model have
#    been written to and have not yet replied, and the working notes include
#    their email addresses and adversarial internal reviews. None of that
#    belongs in a public repository at this stage.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# (1) bulk third-party data
data/raw/boccarella2026/
data/processed/exp04_profile.npz
data/processed/sobol_samples.npz

# (2) the separate line of work, not part of this manuscript
